## Who Actually Sells Royal Asscher Diamonds

The Royal Asscher Diamond Company controls its distribution tightly. You cannot find genuine Royal Asscher stones on Blue Nile, James Allen, Brilliant Earth's standard marketplace, or most online diamond retailers. The company sells through:

- Their flagship store in Amsterdam
- A network of authorized dealers in the US, UK, Europe, and Asia
- A small number of select luxury retailers

This limited distribution is intentional — it protects the brand's exclusivity. It also means you cannot comparison-shop Royal Asscher the way you can shop standard GIA asscher stones. When you can't compare prices across multiple vendors, prices stay high by default.

If you see a "Royal Asscher" stone on an unauthorized marketplace, check the laser inscription carefully. Genuine Royal Asscher stones are inscribed with the Royal Asscher name and serial number on the girdle, verifiable through the Royal Asscher Company's own database. Unauthorized stones sometimes use the name loosely without the actual proprietary cut.

The in-person experience at a Royal Asscher authorized dealer is genuinely different from shopping online. You are not choosing between dozens of certificates on a screen — you are in a curated environment designed to make the premium feel natural. Know going in that you should have done your price research on standard asscher stones beforehand, so you can evaluate whether the premium is worth it for you specifically.

